Package: dolphin
Version: @DEB_DOLPHIN_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://apps.kde.org/dolphin/
Depends: qt6-base, phonon4qt6, kf6-bookmarks, kf6-codecs, kf6-completion, kf6-config, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-crash, kf6-dbusaddons, kf6-i18n, kf6-iconthemes, kf6-kcmutils, kf6-kio, kf6-newstuff, kf6-notifications, kf6-parts, kf6-solid, kf6-textwidgets, kf6-widgetsaddons, kf6-windowsystem
Recommends: konsole
Description: Dolphin file manager (Qt6/KF6)
 KDE's file manager. This first Xios package builds without Baloo,
 BalooWidgets and KFileMetaData, so the Search panel falls back to KIO
 filename search and the Information panel has no tags, ratings or extracted
 metadata; browsing, previews, file operations, split view, places and version
 control integration are upstream. Telemetry and the PackageKit service-menu
 installer are also disabled. The embedded terminal panel needs the konsolepart
 plugin from the konsole package.
